  "prefLabel": "Frl 602.08 Sanitary Facilities",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Frl 602.08 Sanitary Facilities. A funeral home shall contain such toilets, lavatories, and other sanitary facilities as may be required by applicable federal, state, and local laws and regulations.\n\nSource. #1689, eff 12-22-80; ss by#2344, eff 4-15-83; ss by #2986, eff 3-18-85; ss by #4357, eff 1-20-88, EXPIRED: 1-20-94\n\nNew. #10988, eff 12-7-15; ss by #14646, eff 9-4-26, EXPIRES: 9-4-36 (formerly Frl 602.11)",
